'''Deep Sea''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Mystery Box 2]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade resembles ripples deep in the blue sea, hence the name. The guard is blue, and the handle is solid black.  

== Trivia== 
*This is one of the few knives added alongside the [[Season 1]] update.

